WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 8]

02:03.740 --> 02:04.740
Dispatch Rider's Tally.

02:22.900 --> 02:23.980
This is how the frontier troops

02:24.020 --> 02:25.220
tie their prisoners.

02:26.620 --> 02:27.220
Could it be

02:28.340 --> 02:29.100
betrayal from within?

02:33.460 --> 02:34.500
We're dispatch riders from Wangcheng.

02:34.980 --> 02:36.140
The bandits changed into our uniforms

02:36.300 --> 02:38.260
and went to Beicao Post House.

02:39.780 --> 02:41.020
That post house leads directly

02:41.580 --> 02:42.700
to Yunzhong Prefecture.

02:47.940 --> 02:49.580
Judging by your grace and bearing,

02:49.740 --> 02:50.860
you are no ordinary commoner.

02:51.380 --> 02:52.620
How did you end up in this plight?

02:54.340 --> 02:55.340
My mother dotes on me

02:56.500 --> 02:58.180
and wants me to look refined

02:58.820 --> 03:00.100
so that I might be treated
with more respect

03:01.060 --> 03:02.340
once I marry into another family.

03:04.660 --> 03:06.140
The wilderness is no place

03:06.940 --> 03:08.540
for a lady to wander.

03:12.420 --> 03:13.380
If we were to encounter bandits,

03:14.100 --> 03:16.220
the dispatches you carry
are worth far more than I am.

03:16.780 --> 03:17.980
The roads are rough at night

03:18.140 --> 03:19.180
and you're out here alone.

03:19.900 --> 03:20.980
If you cross paths with the outlaws,

03:21.780 --> 03:23.420
you will find yourself

03:23.900 --> 03:24.900
completely left to your fate.

03:25.860 --> 03:27.540
If something actually happens to you,

03:28.660 --> 03:29.900
it'll be too late to wish you hadn't.

03:31.460 --> 03:32.380
You are a woman as well,

03:33.140 --> 03:34.100
so if you are not afraid,

03:35.060 --> 03:35.820
why should I be?

03:42.180 --> 03:43.100
When you speak,

03:43.460 --> 03:44.540
there is no prominence in your throat

03:45.220 --> 03:46.460
and the angle of your radius is smooth.

03:47.660 --> 03:49.500
The pauldrons of your chainmail
hang three cun lower than they should,

03:50.020 --> 03:51.900
which means your shoulders are narrower
than those of a typical male soldier.

03:53.300 --> 03:54.700
Your knees tuck inward

03:55.100 --> 03:56.580
and when you get off a horse,
your toes touch the ground first

03:56.660 --> 03:57.620
rather than the soles of your feet.

03:58.260 --> 03:59.060
It's an ingrained instinct

03:59.060 --> 04:00.660
for a woman to lift her hem
to shun the dirt.

04:02.620 --> 04:03.980
Your flaw lies not in your disguise

04:04.780 --> 04:05.700
but in your habits.

04:06.380 --> 04:07.020
Ma'am,​​

04:07.300 --> 04:08.820
​your disguise is flawless,​​

04:08.940 --> 04:10.700
​but your old habits

04:11.020 --> 04:11.780
can't be faked.

04:13.140 --> 04:14.060
You knew all along

04:14.060 --> 04:15.180
we weren't dispatch riders?

04:16.140 --> 04:17.620
I grew up in the army.

04:18.340 --> 04:20.060
No one knows soldiers better than I do.

04:21.020 --> 04:21.700
Moreover,

04:22.700 --> 04:24.300
you don't act

04:24.500 --> 04:25.420
like dispatch riders,

04:26.340 --> 04:27.220
but more like bandits.

04:29.500 --> 04:30.940
Since you have already seen through us,

04:32.180 --> 04:33.340
why did you still choose to come along?

04:34.180 --> 04:35.620
Aren't you doing the same thing?

04:37.460 --> 04:39.020
Her vow of "My life is worth it"

04:39.060 --> 04:40.300
still exposed us.

04:40.860 --> 04:41.900
You saw through me long ago,

04:42.300 --> 04:43.660
yet you still let me follow you...

04:45.580 --> 04:47.340
because you wanted something from me.

04:57.500 --> 04:58.740
You're sharp.

04:59.620 --> 05:00.460
But it's a pity

05:01.380 --> 05:02.100
the sharp ones

05:03.460 --> 05:04.500
never live long.

05:09.220 --> 05:09.700
What,

05:10.980 --> 05:12.180
are you trying to take my life?

05:13.020 --> 05:13.780
At the post house,

05:15.180 --> 05:16.180
I saw right through the charade

05:16.180 --> 05:17.540
you and that woman staged.

05:17.540 --> 05:18.860
Yet I brought you along anyway

05:19.380 --> 05:20.420
to see

05:20.620 --> 05:23.100
exactly what you hoped to gain

05:23.700 --> 05:25.140
from such an elaborate ruse.

05:38.540 --> 05:39.300
Put down your blade.

05:42.860 --> 05:43.580
I said,

05:44.580 --> 05:45.540
put it down.

05:48.500 --> 05:49.060
Jiu.

05:51.020 --> 05:52.220
Who exactly are you?

05:55.340 --> 05:56.500
You posed as dispatch riders

05:57.060 --> 05:58.300
to intercept intelligence

05:59.020 --> 06:00.300
concerning the Northern Desert.

06:01.380 --> 06:02.260
Chu Ling, the Guard General,

06:02.260 --> 06:03.140
has always been invincible.

06:03.380 --> 06:04.140
It's impossible

06:04.140 --> 06:04.940
for a Northern Desert squad

06:04.940 --> 06:05.580
to have exploited such a gap

06:05.940 --> 06:06.660
unless

06:06.900 --> 06:08.540
someone leaked the dispatch.

06:09.620 --> 06:10.540
How do you know that?

06:11.540 --> 06:13.060
But if you are not closely related,

06:13.820 --> 06:14.740
why go to such lengths?

06:18.100 --> 06:19.100
Unless

06:21.140 --> 06:22.180
you are from the Northern Desert.

06:22.860 --> 06:23.780
They

06:24.300 --> 06:26.140
could never have crossed
Yunzhong Prefecture.

06:30.660 --> 06:31.820
We are from Cangmu Stronghold.

06:39.740 --> 06:40.780
We also suspected

06:41.420 --> 06:42.860
that someone leaked the dispatch.

06:43.540 --> 06:44.660
That is why we targeted
the dispatch riders.

06:45.460 --> 06:48.380
We wanted to find out who at court

06:48.580 --> 06:49.980
is colluding with the Northern Desert

06:50.460 --> 06:51.340
to threaten Yunzhong Prefecture.

06:51.900 --> 06:53.060
Cangmu Stronghold
has always been a mystery,

06:53.060 --> 06:53.820
known to but a few.

06:54.980 --> 06:55.620
Moreover,

06:55.980 --> 06:57.500
you never meddle
in the affairs of the court.

06:58.540 --> 06:59.820
Why start interfering now?

07:00.740 --> 07:02.580
I heard during General Chu's campaign
against bandits,

07:03.060 --> 07:04.500
he killed your former leader,

07:04.500 --> 07:05.260
Mu Mianhong.

07:05.940 --> 07:06.860
Shouldn't you resent him?

07:07.380 --> 07:08.500
Why help him now?

07:09.300 --> 07:10.700
We may be nothing more than bandits,

07:12.060 --> 07:14.220
but we do know ​the nation comes

07:14.780 --> 07:15.780
before personal grudges.​

07:16.820 --> 07:17.660
General Chu

07:17.660 --> 07:19.020
has guarded Yunzhong for 20 years,

07:19.740 --> 07:20.860
keeping the State of Chu in peace.

07:21.980 --> 07:23.460
If someone in the court

07:24.220 --> 07:26.260
colludes with the Northern Desert
​to frame him

07:27.260 --> 07:28.220
the country will be in peril.

07:29.300 --> 07:30.900
As will Cangmu Stronghold.​

07:37.540 --> 07:38.380
To be honest,

07:38.660 --> 07:39.860
I am Chu Ling's daughter.

07:42.340 --> 07:43.460
I heard my father was gravely ill

07:43.700 --> 07:44.820
and was rushing to Yunzhong Prefecture.

07:45.860 --> 07:46.620
I encountered some trouble

07:46.620 --> 07:47.460
on the road.

07:48.220 --> 07:49.180
I had no choice but to disguise myself

07:49.740 --> 07:50.740
and join the dispatch riders.

07:57.300 --> 07:58.260
If you two are in trouble

07:58.260 --> 07:59.260
and need a place to hide,

08:01.620 --> 08:02.940
would you like to follow me back
to the Stronghold?

08:13.740 --> 08:14.340
Sir,​​

08:14.860 --> 08:15.820
​just stopping for a quick bite,​​

08:15.860 --> 08:16.540
​or a night's stay?​

08:17.500 --> 08:18.340
Have you seen any women

08:18.340 --> 08:19.260
bound for Yunzhong Prefecture today?​

08:19.380 --> 08:20.700
There have been plenty of caravans,

08:20.860 --> 08:21.860
and women as well.

08:22.540 --> 08:24.100
Which one are you referring to, exactly?

08:30.380 --> 08:31.580
A runaway maid

08:31.580 --> 08:32.660
who stole from her master.

08:33.780 --> 08:34.700
​She is fair and tender,​​

08:35.060 --> 08:35.980
​bearing no mark of toil.​

08:36.260 --> 08:37.380
​Few maids dare travel

08:37.380 --> 08:38.500
this desolate trail.​

08:38.740 --> 08:39.340
​Let alone

08:39.340 --> 08:40.620
a soft-skinned lady like that.​

08:44.620 --> 08:45.140
​Never seen one.​

08:45.660 --> 08:46.460
Liar.

08:47.380 --> 08:48.380
- You've seen her.
- Officer, please calm down!

08:48.500 --> 08:49.460
Where is she?

08:50.100 --> 08:51.380
Let me think.

08:52.980 --> 08:53.740
I remember now.

08:53.860 --> 08:54.660
There was such a girl.

08:54.980 --> 08:56.100
​She stayed here a couple of days ago,​

08:56.180 --> 08:58.420
​claiming she was visiting kin
in Yunzhong Prefecture.​

08:58.620 --> 08:59.140
Later, she left

08:59.140 --> 09:00.140
with the dispatch riders.

09:00.340 --> 09:01.260
I don't know

09:01.260 --> 09:02.180
where she went after that.

09:03.300 --> 09:04.140
But I do know

09:04.180 --> 09:04.940
where her mother is.

09:05.700 --> 09:06.420
Her mother?

09:06.420 --> 09:06.900
Yes.

09:07.100 --> 09:08.460
Her mother hired a carriage​

09:08.580 --> 09:09.820
​and went back to the village herself.​​

09:10.460 --> 09:11.300
​From that livery stable

09:11.300 --> 09:12.180
three li north of here.​

09:25.020 --> 09:25.820
Come back!

09:26.860 --> 09:27.420
Officer.

09:27.420 --> 09:28.060
Despicable wretch!

09:28.060 --> 09:29.380
You owe me a fortune!

09:29.420 --> 09:29.820
You...!

09:34.700 --> 09:35.420
A few days ago,​​

09:36.020 --> 09:37.060
​did a girl named Fu​

09:37.060 --> 09:37.660
​come through here?​

09:38.180 --> 09:39.780
Officer, what do you mean?​

09:40.140 --> 09:41.660
We get so many girls passing through,​​

09:41.940 --> 09:43.540
​how could I remember every name?​

09:43.540 --> 09:44.180
Don't play dumb.​​

09:45.820 --> 09:47.060
​She paid you to put on an act​

09:47.980 --> 09:49.100
​and then left
with the dispatch riders,​​

09:49.820 --> 09:50.300
​didn't she?​

09:50.460 --> 09:51.100
Yes.​​

09:51.260 --> 09:52.500
​She tricked those dispatch riders​

09:52.540 --> 09:53.780
and they headed for Yunzhong.

10:01.100 --> 10:02.060
​Good.​

10:03.300 --> 10:05.100
Seems you are destined to die.​

10:21.700 --> 10:22.220
​This forest​

10:22.220 --> 10:23.300
​reeks of something foul.​

10:24.140 --> 10:25.020
​The traps and mechanisms

10:25.380 --> 10:26.020
must be over a hundred.

10:27.900 --> 10:29.500
​This is far too elaborate​

10:29.900 --> 10:31.100
​for a mere stronghold of bandits.​​

10:33.500 --> 10:34.380
Are they truly trustworthy?

10:36.100 --> 10:36.900
I'm not sure.

10:37.420 --> 10:38.460
Then why did you insist on coming?

10:44.420 --> 10:45.820
​Madam Ge wasn't lying.​​

10:46.300 --> 10:47.580
​Her story matches perfectly​

10:47.700 --> 10:48.620
​with what I knew of the past.​​

10:49.820 --> 10:50.660
​It seems Cangmu Stronghold​

10:50.660 --> 10:51.740
​wasn't always​

10:52.220 --> 10:53.700
​at odds with my father,​​

10:54.180 --> 10:55.020
​despite what rumors say.​

10:56.220 --> 10:57.420
Tie Ying is no fool.

10:57.980 --> 10:59.020
​My tricks​

10:59.260 --> 11:00.300
​will only last half a day at most.​​

11:01.020 --> 11:02.220
​We are outnumbered.​​

11:02.500 --> 11:03.500
A head-on fight is not the best course.

11:04.020 --> 11:05.660
We'd better seek refuge
in Cangmu Stronghold​

11:06.100 --> 11:07.180
​and plan our next move

11:07.540 --> 11:08.660
after scouting the truth.​​

11:10.540 --> 11:11.220
​So,​​

11:12.500 --> 11:13.300
you're still gambling.

11:14.180 --> 11:15.100
​I dared to risk​​

11:15.500 --> 11:16.380
only because you stood by me.

11:32.780 --> 11:33.620
​Don't get cocky.​​

11:34.540 --> 11:35.220
​Last night,

11:35.220 --> 11:36.140
you were clearly defenseless,

11:36.980 --> 11:38.340
yet you still chose
to provoke the bandits.​​

11:39.780 --> 11:40.580
​Do you realize,​​

11:40.580 --> 11:41.660
​if I'd been a moment later,​​

11:42.300 --> 11:43.700
​you'd be a corpse by now?​​

11:44.260 --> 11:45.580
​If they wanted me dead,​​

11:45.820 --> 11:47.020
​they would have struck​

11:47.020 --> 11:48.740
​when I exposed Madam Ge's disguise.​​

11:50.620 --> 11:51.820
Is that why you risked your life?​​

11:53.220 --> 11:54.820
​Her taking men disguised

11:55.020 --> 11:57.020
as dispatch riders​
​to steal the dispatch

11:57.540 --> 11:58.740
​isn't to hurt my father

11:59.660 --> 12:01.060
​but to uncover the truth.

12:01.780 --> 12:02.620
In other words,

12:03.300 --> 12:04.340
​she truly is helping him.

12:05.700 --> 12:06.540
​Aren't you afraid

12:07.300 --> 12:09.220
​you've jumped out of the frying pan
​and straight into the fire?

12:09.860 --> 12:11.700
Isn't that

12:12.380 --> 12:12.980
just what we do

12:12.980 --> 12:14.260
every day?​

12:27.780 --> 12:29.100
[Cangmu Stronghold]

12:29.100 --> 12:29.860
Ge is back.

12:30.180 --> 12:30.940
Ge's returned.

12:31.060 --> 12:31.580
Ge.

12:31.860 --> 12:32.380
Ge.

12:33.940 --> 12:34.460
Ge.

12:34.580 --> 12:35.260
Welcome back.

12:35.500 --> 12:36.260
Ge.

12:36.260 --> 12:36.820
Let me take that.

12:37.300 --> 12:37.820
Ge.

12:40.300 --> 12:40.820
Aunt.

12:42.500 --> 12:43.100
​Laosan,​​

12:43.580 --> 12:44.140
​we have guests.​​

12:44.540 --> 12:45.180
​Coming.​​

12:47.540 --> 12:48.180
​This is my younger brother,​​

12:48.540 --> 12:50.220
​Ge Laosan, leader
of Cangmu Stronghold.​

12:50.980 --> 12:51.740
Greetings, Mr. Ge.

12:51.980 --> 12:53.740
[Ge Laosan of Cangmu Stronghold]

12:54.500 --> 12:54.980
Xiaoman.

12:55.060 --> 12:56.020
[Mu Xiaoman of Cangmu Stronghold]

12:57.620 --> 12:58.020
Take a seat.

12:59.380 --> 13:00.580
Why'd you bring two strangers back?​

13:02.940 --> 13:04.020
We need a place to lie low for a while.

13:04.180 --> 13:04.900
Lie low?

13:06.140 --> 13:08.180
What should I address you two?​​

13:08.740 --> 13:09.420
​He's Jiu.​​

13:09.820 --> 13:10.460
​I'm Fu.​

13:11.260 --> 13:12.300
Fu.​​

13:13.580 --> 13:14.540
​Good name.​​

13:15.260 --> 13:16.900
​Sounds like good fortune.​

13:19.940 --> 13:20.500
Madam Ge,​​

13:21.180 --> 13:22.620
there's something I need to ask.​​

13:22.980 --> 13:24.100
I know what it is.​​

13:25.100 --> 13:25.740
Don't worry.

13:26.660 --> 13:27.700
​​You saw it for yourselves

13:27.700 --> 13:28.580
on the way in.

13:29.220 --> 13:30.420
We are known as Cangmu Stronghold,

13:30.860 --> 13:32.140
hidden deep within these woods.

13:33.100 --> 13:34.300
There's a saying down the mountain.

13:34.700 --> 13:35.820
​​"Once you go deep
into Cangmu Forest,​​

13:36.140 --> 13:37.140
​there's no way out."​

13:37.620 --> 13:39.060
This forest is vast and deep,

13:39.420 --> 13:40.580
a fortress built by nature itself.

13:40.940 --> 13:42.340
And we have all those hidden mechanisms

13:42.380 --> 13:43.060
and traps.

13:43.540 --> 13:44.620
With bamboo nets overhead,

13:45.140 --> 13:46.220
and vine-traps underfoot,

13:46.780 --> 13:47.900
all life is barred from entry,​​

13:48.220 --> 13:49.380
​be it human or beast.​

13:49.940 --> 13:50.580
Here,

13:51.340 --> 13:52.460
you're safer than anywhere outside.

13:53.380 --> 13:54.820
​If this place is so secret,​​

13:56.180 --> 13:57.660
​how could you trust us enough

13:57.860 --> 13:58.740
to let us in?​

13:59.460 --> 14:00.300
Aren't you afraid?​

14:00.820 --> 14:02.580
​We value fate above all.​​

14:02.860 --> 14:03.660
​I've trusted you,​​

14:04.180 --> 14:05.140
​so I won't question it.​

14:09.100 --> 14:09.660
Xiaoman,​

14:10.180 --> 14:11.380
​see to our guests.​

14:11.660 --> 14:12.820
Once things calm down out there,​​

14:13.100 --> 14:14.340
​you can resume your journey.​

14:16.700 --> 14:17.420
​My gratitude, Ma'am.​

14:19.300 --> 14:20.380
Apologies for the intrusion.​

14:20.900 --> 14:22.340
​No trouble at all.​​

14:23.340 --> 14:24.380
This way please.​

14:27.380 --> 14:28.980
Have a good rest.

14:34.380 --> 14:35.020
She...?

14:52.020 --> 14:52.740
Mr. Tie!

14:53.540 --> 14:54.180
Mr. Tie.

14:57.460 --> 14:58.020
Mr. Tie.

14:58.220 --> 14:58.780
Something's wrong.

14:58.980 --> 14:59.900
The dispatch riders we were pursuing,

14:59.900 --> 15:00.660
along with the Grand Princess,

15:00.900 --> 15:02.060
have vanished without a trace

15:02.340 --> 15:03.380
near Cangmu Stronghold.

15:04.100 --> 15:04.940
The men we dispatched in pursuit​

15:05.420 --> 15:06.220
​were all slain​

15:06.220 --> 15:07.420
​by the bandits of the stronghold​.

15:08.660 --> 15:09.660
Cangmu Stronghold?

15:10.940 --> 15:11.820
I promised His Highness

15:12.660 --> 15:14.060
to bring back

15:14.060 --> 15:14.900
Chu Zhao's head.

15:16.740 --> 15:17.820
Hear my command.

15:18.420 --> 15:19.180
Pick up the pace

15:19.660 --> 15:20.740
and march into Cangmu Forest.

15:21.060 --> 15:22.180
Leave no one alive.

15:22.700 --> 15:23.580
​I'd like to see

15:23.900 --> 15:25.100
what these remnants ​think

15:25.900 --> 15:27.380
they can do to shield her.​

15:38.020 --> 15:39.420
​They offered you shelter,​

15:39.940 --> 15:40.540
​and now you're raiding

15:40.540 --> 15:41.380
their armory?​

15:42.020 --> 15:42.860
Cangmu Forest is vast and deep.​​

15:43.300 --> 15:45.340
They seem hospitable enough,

15:45.660 --> 15:46.620
but how could we truly rest easy​

15:46.740 --> 15:48.500
​without investigating first?​​

15:49.940 --> 15:50.780
I didn't realize,

15:50.860 --> 15:52.780
though new to the jianghu,
you would think further ahead than I.​

15:54.940 --> 15:55.620
Look at this.

15:58.180 --> 15:58.860
Careful.

16:05.340 --> 16:06.460
Seven modifications to the mechanism.

16:06.860 --> 16:08.060
Range increased by two zhang,

16:09.060 --> 16:10.260
with less recoil.

16:11.540 --> 16:12.460
These are modified crossbows

16:12.660 --> 16:13.700
the frontier troops used

16:14.260 --> 16:15.300
against the Northern Desert.

16:16.540 --> 16:17.300
​How do you know?​

16:17.900 --> 16:18.900
Back when I was in the army,​

16:19.140 --> 16:19.780
​I modified

16:19.780 --> 16:20.900
over 200 of these crossbows​
for the General.​

16:22.780 --> 16:23.620
Mu Mianhong​

16:23.740 --> 16:25.140
​was killed by my father, after all.​​

16:26.020 --> 16:26.940
​So why would her stronghold​

16:27.540 --> 16:28.900
​have weapons from the frontier troops?​

16:29.620 --> 16:30.300
It's not just that.

16:31.740 --> 16:32.860
While searching for you,​​

16:33.380 --> 16:33.860
​I saved a dispatch rider​

16:33.860 --> 16:35.220
​who had been kidnapped by Madam Ge.​

16:36.140 --> 16:37.660
The knots used to tie him up​

16:38.620 --> 16:40.180
​were standard frontier troop rigging.​

16:41.140 --> 16:42.420
You mean​​...?

16:42.900 --> 16:43.660
Perhaps

16:44.780 --> 16:45.780
your father wasn't here

16:46.020 --> 16:47.060
to suppress bandits.

16:47.580 --> 16:48.380
What are you implying?

16:48.900 --> 16:49.700
Are you suggesting

16:50.140 --> 16:50.900
my father...?

16:50.900 --> 16:51.740
Wait for me.​​

17:00.700 --> 17:01.460
​I won't be long.​

17:58.540 --> 17:59.700
Your Highness,

18:00.660 --> 18:01.980
this feels a little too personal.

18:04.300 --> 18:05.500
Back when I left the Capital,

18:05.940 --> 18:06.780
who was it that swore

18:07.060 --> 18:08.380
to guard the imperial city for me?

18:15.220 --> 18:15.900
​I know

18:16.820 --> 18:17.860
it's because you care about me.​

18:21.220 --> 18:23.300
​But Xie Yanfang wouldn't release you
​without expecting

18:24.020 --> 18:24.900
something in return.​

18:26.380 --> 18:27.420
What's the situation at court?

18:28.220 --> 18:30.620
He'll look after Yu.

18:31.860 --> 18:32.980
But he needs the Grand Princess Token

18:33.820 --> 18:34.700
to keep Deng Yi on a leash.

18:37.500 --> 18:38.980
So I handed it over.

18:46.460 --> 18:47.060
Indeed.

18:48.580 --> 18:49.780
Your brother

18:50.620 --> 18:51.340
has never been one

18:51.340 --> 18:53.020
to show his hand
without a guaranteed win.

18:54.180 --> 18:55.260
If you're not in the Capital,

18:56.220 --> 18:57.140
he's the only one

18:57.500 --> 18:58.780
who can keep Yu safe.

19:04.580 --> 19:05.580
​Your wounds have yet to heal.​

19:05.900 --> 19:07.020
You need proper rest.

19:10.780 --> 19:11.500
Just get some sleep.

19:28.020 --> 19:28.740
They

19:30.260 --> 19:31.740
only gave us one room?

19:36.940 --> 19:38.060
​I insisted on this.​

19:40.420 --> 19:41.660
With such grave injuries,

19:43.420 --> 19:44.900
you need to stay close to me.

19:45.900 --> 19:47.020
Or how am I supposed to protect you?

19:57.900 --> 19:59.260
♪Flowing lights along the streets♪

19:59.580 --> 20:02.220
♪Dye the world in shades of indigo♪

20:03.380 --> 20:04.580
And how will you protect me exactly?​

20:05.140 --> 20:08.980
♪Making people forget their secrets♪

20:13.180 --> 20:15.180
♪Your silhouette♪

20:15.620 --> 20:19.020
♪Carries a hazy beauty♪

20:19.420 --> 20:21.900
♪You gave up♪

20:22.260 --> 20:24.980
♪Waiting for me to come near♪

20:25.860 --> 20:26.980
It's a cold night.

20:28.900 --> 20:29.980
Your wounds won't heal if you freeze.

20:30.700 --> 20:31.980
♪Toward tomorrow or dreams♪

20:32.220 --> 20:34.500
♪Without asking why♪

20:35.500 --> 20:36.340
Keep warm.

20:37.260 --> 20:41.820
♪Deliberately letting go of my hand♪

20:42.980 --> 20:45.380
♪Were you also worried♪

20:45.700 --> 20:50.700
♪That courage alone can't earn
the dawn of morning?♪

20:51.580 --> 20:53.260
Are you out of your mind?​

20:54.580 --> 20:56.100
​You knew who she was​

20:56.660 --> 20:57.780
​and you still brought her here?​

21:11.020 --> 21:12.460
​They're not to be trifled with.​

21:13.900 --> 21:14.860
​Xiao Xun's ambushes​

21:15.860 --> 21:17.420
​always have a deeper kill.​

21:18.500 --> 21:19.740
That guard at the gate

21:19.740 --> 21:20.980
​sent word in the White Wolf tongue,

21:22.020 --> 21:23.740
saying the pursuers
have all been eliminated.

21:24.500 --> 21:25.780
If they were with Xiao Xun,

21:26.740 --> 21:28.060
why would they kill their own?

21:29.060 --> 21:30.180
I didn't know
you could speak that tongue.

21:31.540 --> 21:32.660
My father taught me​

21:33.220 --> 21:34.100
​when we were in the desert.​

21:36.340 --> 21:37.220
No one

21:38.620 --> 21:39.540
knows that

21:41.060 --> 21:41.980
except him.

21:43.100 --> 21:44.460
But what if it's all just an act?

21:45.420 --> 21:46.140
Xiao Xun's men

21:46.140 --> 21:47.300
have no reason to slaughter their own.

21:48.180 --> 21:49.100
Given how cautious

21:50.100 --> 21:51.180
Deng Yi is,

21:52.100 --> 21:53.020
he'd never trust a band of bandits

21:53.020 --> 21:54.500
who still answer to their old master.

21:55.100 --> 21:55.860
He wouldn't trust them.

21:57.020 --> 21:58.100
And Xie Yanfang?

21:58.700 --> 21:59.780
Even less likely.

22:01.380 --> 22:02.300
Whether Madam Ge

22:02.300 --> 22:04.100
and the others respect
my father or fear him,

22:05.860 --> 22:06.780
at the very least,

22:08.620 --> 22:09.740
my father never bore them

22:11.100 --> 22:12.060
any ill will.

22:13.220 --> 22:14.620
​I still find it hard to believe​

22:15.860 --> 22:16.940
​they've suddenly turned into saints.​

22:18.180 --> 22:19.020
Are you willing

22:20.100 --> 22:22.260
to take a gamble with me?

22:23.140 --> 22:24.300
What if we lose?

22:33.980 --> 22:35.620
​At least on the road to the afterlife,​

22:37.300 --> 22:38.060
​you'll keep me company.​

22:46.100 --> 22:47.340
Recently, our dispatch riders

22:47.340 --> 22:48.940
were ambushed
near the Beicao Post House.

22:49.460 --> 22:50.180
Investigations confirm

22:50.260 --> 22:51.300
that this was the work
of the Cangmu Stronghold.

22:51.820 --> 22:53.140
This is an absolute outrage.

22:54.060 --> 22:55.220
Utterly preposterous.

22:56.220 --> 22:58.780
Chu Ling's leniency
allowed these bandits to flourish.

22:59.180 --> 23:00.700
Now, the remnants of that stronghold

23:00.700 --> 23:01.580
have the audacity

23:01.940 --> 23:04.700
to pose as our dispatch riders
to steal vital military intelligence.

23:05.260 --> 23:06.700
Your Majesty, I implore you

23:07.140 --> 23:08.180
to issue a decree
for a full investigation

23:08.500 --> 23:09.940
and ensure that justice is served.

23:10.860 --> 23:13.300
General Chu marched against the bandits
on imperial command.

23:13.900 --> 23:15.060
When the bandit leader, Mu Mianhong,

23:15.060 --> 23:15.980
took her life by leaping from the cliff,

23:16.580 --> 23:17.940
he refused to harm
even the women and children

23:17.980 --> 23:18.980
remaining in the stronghold.

23:19.780 --> 23:20.900
To think that such benevolence

23:21.940 --> 23:23.540
is being wielded against him?

23:25.500 --> 23:26.020
Your Majesty,

23:26.540 --> 23:27.620
an urgent report has just arrived.

23:28.100 --> 23:29.700
The Northern Desert
dispatched an envoy to Yunzhong,

23:29.980 --> 23:31.780
only for General Chu
to execute him on the spot.

23:32.340 --> 23:33.220
Tensions between the two states

23:33.420 --> 23:34.740
are already high.

23:34.940 --> 23:36.420
What are we to do now?

23:36.860 --> 23:39.380
Even in war,
one does not kill a messenger.

23:39.780 --> 23:42.820
This act will surely incite them
to take up arms.

23:43.380 --> 23:45.340
The charge of leniency toward bandits
might be overlooked,

23:45.340 --> 23:47.180
but inciting a war

23:47.460 --> 23:48.620
is unpardonable.

23:49.380 --> 23:51.380
First, they breached our frontier.

23:51.980 --> 23:53.300
Then, their envoy infiltrated

23:53.300 --> 23:54.540
the General's tent

23:54.620 --> 23:56.340
with a secret letter at night.

23:57.260 --> 23:59.140
If that isn't espionage, then what is?

23:59.300 --> 24:00.740
Mr. Deng is correct.

24:01.580 --> 24:03.580
The General has commanded
the frontier troops for decades,

24:03.580 --> 24:04.460
with his defenses impregnable.

24:04.980 --> 24:06.060
If they nearly faltered last time,

24:06.660 --> 24:08.660
it must be because a spy
leaked our positions.

24:09.460 --> 24:10.740
Desperate times

24:11.060 --> 24:12.580
demand desperate measures.

24:13.260 --> 24:14.180
According to our laws,

24:14.420 --> 24:15.620
when a threat is imminent and unclear,

24:16.140 --> 24:17.500
one may act first​
and report thereafter.​

24:18.300 --> 24:19.940
So how can General Chu be blamed?

24:23.300 --> 24:23.860
Your Majesty,​​

24:24.300 --> 24:25.980
​General Chu is advanced in years.​​

24:26.380 --> 24:28.300
As the frontier defenses
have seen repeated breaches,

24:28.780 --> 24:30.900
​I beg Your Majesty
to appoint another worthy general.​

24:32.980 --> 24:34.300
These concerns are not without merit.

24:34.860 --> 24:36.500
As the Northern Desert stirs
with ambition,

24:36.900 --> 24:38.020
we must fortify

24:38.780 --> 24:40.100
the frontier

24:40.140 --> 24:41.500
in anticipation of conflict.

24:43.420 --> 24:45.300
As for the selection of a successor,

24:47.700 --> 24:49.460
it remains a matter
for His Majesty's judgment.

24:50.140 --> 24:52.380
The General has held Yunzhong
for 20 years.

24:52.900 --> 24:54.100
Each time the enemy dared to invade,

24:54.260 --> 24:55.740
they were repelled
in ignominious defeat.

24:56.580 --> 24:58.660
In your candidate list,

24:59.100 --> 25:01.100
how many can truly rival

25:01.180 --> 25:02.260
his illustrious record?

25:02.980 --> 25:04.380
A commander of such stature
is not cultivated overnight.

25:05.140 --> 25:07.260
Yet, the security of the frontier

25:07.820 --> 25:09.380
cannot be staked
upon a single individual.

25:10.820 --> 25:12.180
​Mr. Xie, please set your mind at rest.​

25:12.580 --> 25:13.860
​I shall confer

25:13.860 --> 25:15.140
with the ministers​

25:15.460 --> 25:17.740
​to select the most fitting candidate

25:18.500 --> 25:19.700
for Yunzhong Prefecture

25:20.500 --> 25:22.140
to alleviate the General's burdens.

25:28.700 --> 25:29.980
What a masterful move

25:30.780 --> 25:32.020
he's played.

25:50.020 --> 25:50.700
This is...

25:52.180 --> 25:52.820
​Sand Fox Whistle.​

25:53.340 --> 25:54.020
That's right.

25:55.100 --> 25:56.020
This is a frontier troop alert

25:56.100 --> 25:57.180
for cavalry raids.

25:59.140 --> 26:00.500
Stubborn, aren't you?

26:01.940 --> 26:02.580
Talk.

26:03.620 --> 26:04.460
If you won't,

26:05.380 --> 26:06.420
I'll chop you to pieces

26:06.700 --> 26:08.340
and feed you to the wolves in the hills.

26:08.580 --> 26:11.100
- Throw him to the wolves!
- Throw him to the wolves!

26:11.220 --> 26:11.860
Talk or not?

26:14.980 --> 26:15.940
What are you doing here?

26:17.100 --> 26:18.380
I'm in the middle of something.

26:18.700 --> 26:19.660
Don't mind me.

26:20.100 --> 26:20.740
Leave him to me.

26:52.580 --> 26:53.140
Well?

26:53.980 --> 26:54.580
He talked.

26:55.300 --> 26:55.820
They entered

26:55.820 --> 26:56.700
Cangmu Forest yesterday

26:57.300 --> 26:58.060
and located

26:58.060 --> 26:58.860
Cangmu Stronghold.

26:59.340 --> 27:00.380
Their men will arrive tonight.

27:01.060 --> 27:01.980
We should prepare in advance.

27:02.820 --> 27:04.140
I need to tell my sister.

27:33.900 --> 27:34.700
Did you learn

27:34.700 --> 27:36.100
those interrogation tricks

27:36.300 --> 27:37.180
from

27:37.180 --> 27:38.260
my father's army?

27:39.700 --> 27:40.380
Not really.

27:42.340 --> 27:43.820
He advocated
for the humane treatment of captives.

27:45.020 --> 27:46.620
He'd never have used torture on them.

27:51.860 --> 27:52.580
Are you not afraid anymore?

27:53.780 --> 27:54.860
Why would I?

27:55.780 --> 27:57.140
I grew up in military camps.

27:57.700 --> 27:58.980
I've seen my share

28:00.140 --> 28:01.540
of slaughter and bloodshed.

28:09.820 --> 28:11.300
That is no blessing.

28:13.060 --> 28:13.980
Better to have never seen it at all.

28:20.580 --> 28:21.740
But in this life,

28:22.300 --> 28:23.300
who truly has a choice?

28:24.980 --> 28:25.900
I have no desire to kill,

28:26.460 --> 28:27.700
yet they come for my life.

28:29.380 --> 28:30.540
I told you

28:31.940 --> 28:32.660
I kill

28:33.860 --> 28:35.540
just so I can stay alive.

28:37.940 --> 28:38.900
I want to live

28:39.740 --> 28:41.060
to see my father again.

28:42.580 --> 28:43.460
I will do the killing for you.

28:49.660 --> 28:50.140
Hey.

28:50.460 --> 28:51.220
​The ones after them​

28:51.340 --> 28:54.180
​belong to Xiao Xun,​
heir to the Lord of Xiaonan.

28:55.420 --> 28:56.740
A humble meal

28:58.140 --> 28:59.540
in a humble place.​

29:02.140 --> 29:03.500
I hope Your Highness can forgive me.

29:24.140 --> 29:25.740
​You are the Grand Princess?​

29:26.540 --> 29:27.100
No.

29:27.100 --> 29:28.820
You were supposed to marry

29:28.820 --> 29:29.860
the heir to the Lord of Xiaonan.

29:31.620 --> 29:32.500
So you eloped with this man?

29:42.100 --> 29:43.220
Xiao Xun deceived me.

29:44.300 --> 29:45.260
Everything he wanted,

29:45.980 --> 29:46.900
from the very start,

29:46.900 --> 29:48.060
was my father's command

29:48.060 --> 29:49.140
over the army.

29:50.220 --> 29:51.420
But I won't let him have it.

29:53.900 --> 29:54.580
Never ever.

29:56.020 --> 29:57.740
You're Chu Ling's daughter.​​

29:58.540 --> 29:59.700
​Did he ever tell you​

29:59.780 --> 30:00.660
​who your mother was?​​

30:09.460 --> 30:10.460
​Mr. Ge,​​

30:10.620 --> 30:12.340
​you take quite an interest
in Yunzhong Prefecture.​

30:13.180 --> 30:13.900
You even know every detail​

30:13.900 --> 30:15.140
​of my betrothal.​

30:16.100 --> 30:17.340
No wonder this stronghold​

30:17.940 --> 30:18.900
​bears the marks

30:20.340 --> 30:21.460
of frontier troops.​

30:31.580 --> 30:33.100
Since we're speaking so frankly,​​

30:33.580 --> 30:35.100
Ma'am,
you might as well tell the truth.​

30:35.940 --> 30:36.860
What really happened

30:37.340 --> 30:38.500
when my father went

30:40.140 --> 30:41.500
to Cangmu Stronghold?

30:43.060 --> 30:43.980
Nothing much.

30:45.340 --> 30:46.420
It's just

30:47.220 --> 30:48.260
that General Chu

30:48.580 --> 30:50.060
killed our former leader.

30:50.660 --> 30:52.660
Then why do you still care
about him so much?

30:53.420 --> 30:54.980
Don't you want to avenge

30:55.660 --> 30:56.740
your leader?

31:03.900 --> 31:04.620
Back then,

31:05.540 --> 31:07.380
word got out
that we were raiding the frontier,

31:07.980 --> 31:09.460
so General Chu came to eradicate us.

31:10.580 --> 31:12.260
But after killing the former leader,
he realized

31:12.580 --> 31:13.660
it was all a misunderstanding.

31:14.820 --> 31:15.980
So he stepped in to resettle

31:15.980 --> 31:16.900
the rest of us.

31:17.460 --> 31:18.500
Everything you see now

31:19.340 --> 31:20.860
is just your father's guilt

31:21.780 --> 31:22.500
and his way of making amends.

31:24.180 --> 31:24.740
But...

31:24.780 --> 31:25.580
The debt has been settled.

31:27.180 --> 31:28.100
There's no point bringing it up anymore.

31:32.020 --> 31:33.020
You've had a long journey.

31:33.540 --> 31:34.580
Why don't you try to get some rest?

31:35.300 --> 31:36.380
I'm right here if you need anything.

31:54.660 --> 31:56.260
​They aren't like ordinary bandits.​

31:57.260 --> 31:58.940
Their story
about the General's campaign,

31:59.660 --> 32:00.860
​how he supposedly killed the innocents,

32:01.740 --> 32:03.060
​is rather flimsy.​

32:05.140 --> 32:06.780
Largely fiction, with a grain of truth.​

32:09.260 --> 32:10.580
But I do believe my father

32:10.740 --> 32:12.380
genuinely wanted to protect this place.

32:13.300 --> 32:14.660
And I'm certain

32:15.500 --> 32:16.380
they mean no harm

32:17.060 --> 32:17.780
to us.

32:18.420 --> 32:19.540
As for the rest...

32:20.900 --> 32:21.940
Everyone has secrets.

32:23.020 --> 32:24.460
When they'll finally come to light,

32:25.780 --> 32:26.740
that's just a matter of fate.

32:33.780 --> 32:34.900
Wangcheng is just ahead.

32:35.460 --> 32:36.180
Past it

32:36.780 --> 32:37.740
lies Yunzhong Prefecture.

32:39.900 --> 32:40.580
Once we deal with

32:40.580 --> 32:41.700
Xiao Xun's men,

32:44.740 --> 32:46.020
you'll finally see your father.

32:48.380 --> 32:49.020
I know.

32:50.980 --> 32:51.660
I know this road

32:54.100 --> 32:55.060
all too well.

33:01.820 --> 33:02.500
Back then,

33:04.020 --> 33:05.660
this was the exact path I took

33:07.380 --> 33:08.420
to be away from my father,

33:10.900 --> 33:12.300
Yunzhong Prefecture,

33:13.820 --> 33:15.300
and everything that held me dear,

33:16.220 --> 33:17.540
only to fall​

33:19.420 --> 33:21.260
into the mire of eternal doom.​

33:46.300 --> 33:47.060
Jiu.

33:49.380 --> 33:50.220
If we had

33:50.220 --> 33:51.500
a second chance at life,

33:53.180 --> 33:55.100
would anything actually change?

34:04.700 --> 34:05.500
A second chance

34:07.580 --> 34:08.980
at life...

34:12.180 --> 34:12.740
Jiu.

34:12.970 --> 34:14.580
From now on, the Xie Residence
will be your home.

34:15.740 --> 34:17.300
Mother, mother!

34:38.020 --> 34:38.980
Perhaps it wouldn't change a thing.

34:41.100 --> 34:42.180
But for me,

34:43.900 --> 34:45.340
things are already different.

34:48.660 --> 34:49.700
Remember

34:50.780 --> 34:52.340
that dream I told you about?

34:54.380 --> 34:55.660
At the very end,

34:57.060 --> 34:57.940
someone killed

34:58.740 --> 34:59.900
Xiao Xun for me.

35:02.780 --> 35:04.460
Do you know who it was?

35:06.780 --> 35:08.100
It was you.

35:16.940 --> 35:18.540
You killed him

35:19.460 --> 35:21.260
and avenged my family.

35:25.460 --> 35:26.380
But this time,

35:29.420 --> 35:31.020
I have to do it myself.

35:31.860 --> 35:34.140
Though fear may still echo in my chest,

35:36.100 --> 35:38.540
and a crumbling cliff
awaits my next step,

35:39.220 --> 35:40.100
nothing in this world

35:43.260 --> 35:44.620
will hold me back.

35:45.380 --> 35:47.980
♪Through biting winds and frost I go♪

35:48.500 --> 35:50.620
♪I light a lamp, my lone abode♪

35:51.340 --> 35:53.440
♪Half my life adrift♪

35:53.440 --> 35:57.220
♪This lonely shadow
finds no haven to moor♪

35:59.300 --> 36:01.650
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

36:01.650 --> 36:03.420
♪And roars in the blaze♪

36:03.420 --> 36:06.860
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

36:06.860 --> 36:09.140
♪Fate imprisons me♪

36:09.140 --> 36:13.860
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

36:14.100 --> 36:16.620
♪Even if hope is faint♪

36:16.620 --> 36:18.420
♪I remain proud♪

36:18.420 --> 36:21.420
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

36:21.420 --> 36:22.940
Whatever you fear in the days to come,

36:24.940 --> 36:25.860
whatever that dream may be,

36:27.340 --> 36:29.100
real or not,

36:30.860 --> 36:31.740
​face it,

36:33.620 --> 36:34.300
grasp it,

36:36.020 --> 36:36.780
and conquer it.​

36:38.380 --> 36:43.060
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

36:43.780 --> 36:45.020
And the fear will leave you.​

36:46.700 --> 36:47.540
​I'm not terrified.​

36:50.260 --> 36:51.380
My father and I

36:53.620 --> 36:55.180
will survive.

36:56.620 --> 36:59.980
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

37:00.300 --> 37:02.260
♪Fate imprisons me♪

37:02.460 --> 37:07.300
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

37:07.420 --> 37:11.740
♪Even if hope is faint,
